{"id":"u-25c92771-087f-4674-8085-54796013cc7c","src":"community","title":"Hybrid Calisthenics / Weight lifting program","author":"JackJDBushill","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/rBzMk1-hybrid-calisthenics-weight-lifting-program","desc":"**Hybrid Calisthenics / Weight Lifting Program**\n\nThis 8-week hybrid program is designed to build a strong foundation for calisthenics while still allowing you to progress and grow through traditional weight training. By combining bodyweight movements with key weighted lifts, the program develops strength, muscle, and control without sacrificing either discipline.\n\nAcross 32 structured sessions, you’ll improve relative strength, core stability, and movement quality — all essential for calisthenics — while continuing to build size, power, and confidence in your weightlifting performance. The balance of volume and intensity supports consistent progression, making this program ideal for anyone who wants to be capable with their bodyweight while still building an impressive physique in the gym.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Bodyweight Fitness","Muscle"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":14,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-09-06T00:17:52.866Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push + TCS","Posterior chain","Upper + Arms","Legs + Core"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":3}]}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Single Arm)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dragon Flag","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x"